'Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedCoveragePersistence.node_transport' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
@Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedCoveragePersistence.node_transport : ∀ {roles : Yulang.Roles.RoleDecls}
  {registry : Yulang.GeneralDeclarations.Registry} {before after : Yulang.GeneralNominalSupport.Tracked roles},
  (∀ (packet : Yulang.GeneralNominalSaturationState.Packet roles),
      packet ∈ before.current.packets → packet ∈ after.current.packets) →
    Yulang.GeneralDictionaryOrdinaryTrace.Extension before.current.context after.current.context →
      ∀ {occurrence : Yulang.GeneralSourceDictionaries.Occurrence roles}
        (node : Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedCoverage.Node registry before occurrence),
        ∃ next, next.children = node.children ∧ next.key = node.key
